{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HelmetFire is a rougelite motorcycle multitasking type endless runner that is as relaxing, or as taxing, as you want it to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock endless score multipliers and compete on the online leaderboard to be the best, or unwind and watch the numbers go up at your own pace. Featuring endlessly engaging core gameplay, a variety of different environments with a <i>unique</i> visual style, a relaxingly pure soundtrack, and plenty of choices to make your experience as challenging, or as manageable, as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring competitive seasons where the top players on the leaderboard get the opportunity to have items of their choice added in game for the next competitive season, and planned post launch content to expand the endgame experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755620?t=1752130942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755620?t=1752130942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755620/214634fc5e6ba4757ecc0d98a636dbc60bdf9b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752130942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755620/214634fc5e6ba4757ecc0d98a636dbc60bdf9b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752130942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HelmetFire is a rougelite motorcycle multitasking type endless runner that is as relaxing, or as taxing, as you want it to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock endless score multipliers and compete on the online leaderboard to be the best, or unwind and watch the numbers go up at your own pace. Featuring endlessly engaging core gameplay, a variety of different environments with a <i>unique</i> visual style, a relaxingly pure soundtrack, and plenty of choices to make your experience as challenging, or as manageable, as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring competitive seasons where the top players on the leaderboard get the opportunity to have items of their choice added in game for the next competitive season, and planned post launch content to expand the endgame experience.</p>","developers":["Snick Developments"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755620/5288f2bb208ed3f0d891a0f469278844c679beae/header.jpg?t=1752130942","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3755620/1284242079/4c89dbcdd76dcd6323bd875011e4c7bd0b17b715/1750382434/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750974061","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3755620/1284242079/4c89dbcdd76dcd6323bd875011e4c7bd0b17b715/1750382434/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750974061","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3755620/1284242079/4c89dbcdd76dcd6323bd875011e4c7bd0b17b715/1750382434/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750974061","id":257158459,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158459/movie480.mp4?t=1750974061","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158459/movie_max.mp4?t=1750974061"},"name":"Helmet Fire Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158459/2df379f02e0c78bce8be60a2e86c61cec68f6c4e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750974061","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158459/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750974061","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co